  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "For a pilot study section, I need, for each of my 12 patients separately, a map of which genes rise and fall together, with a p-value on every link so I can keep only the confident ones. The expression is log2-transformed and centered, genes in rows with patient IDs as headers."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"a map of which genes rise and fall together, with a p-value on every link so I can keep only the confident ones\" -- available from LIONESS-COEXPRESSION.\n\nSelected path: **LIONESS-COEXPRESSION**.\n\nYour question asks for a co-expression network. **LIONESS-COEXPRESSION** fits that result. LIONESS represents the cohort network through sample contributions: W_q = N*W_all - (N-1)*W_without_q, where N is the cohort size and the same base estimator is fitted with and without sample q.\n\nCaptured request parameters:\n\n- `expression_file`: log2-transformed\n\n**LIONESS-COEXPRESSION**: Infer aggregate and sample-specific co-expression networks with LIONESS.\n\nRouting-level input modality: gene expression.\n\nMethod premise: derive each sample network from all-sample and leave-one-out networks.\n\nLIONESS represents the cohort network through sample contributions: W_q = N*W_all - (N-1)*W_without_q, where N is the cohort size and the same base estimator is fitted with and without sample q. The leave-one-out network alone is not the patient's network. This borrows cohort information; it does not estimate a correlation from one isolated observation or prove causality. With PANDA, edge weights are inferred regulatory support, not measured binding strength. Cross-sectional networks do not establish temporal rewiring.\n\nRequired workflow inputs:\n\n- `expression_file`: expression matrix\n\nDistinct declared output artifacts (availability depends on workflow options):\n\n- `coexpression_network`: Inferred gene-to-gene associations.\n\nInput compatibility has not been assessed: your data was not checked against the workflow's required inputs; name your input files to have them checked. This is workflow guidance only; no execution was authorized. No files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
